Maintainer: Evgeniy Patlan <evgeniy.patlan@percona.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2

Package: valkey-admin-server
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: Fixture stand-in for the pre-rename valkey-admin-server package
 Ships the same unbranded paths as the real percona-valkey-admin-server
 package -- the systemd unit, the /etc/valkey-admin/valkey-admin.env
 conffile, /var/lib/valkey-admin, and a payload marker under
 /usr/lib/valkey-admin-server -- with no application payload, and the real
 pre-rename postinst/postrm so ownership, permissions and the purge branch
 behave exactly as they did on the package this rename replaced. Used only
 by tests/test-upgrade-deb.sh to exercise the rename upgrade's
 Replaces/Conflicts resolution. Test infrastructure only -- never built or
 shipped as a real artifact.
